# 🤖 AI Government Service Assistant

An AI-powered Government Public Service Assistant that helps citizens easily discover government schemes, understand required documents, ask questions in natural language, and interact through text or voice.

This project combines Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing (NLP), Machine Learning, and Large Language Models (LLMs) to make government services more accessible.

---

# 📌 Features

- 💬 AI Chatbot for government-related queries
- 🗣️ Voice Input using Whisper
- 🔊 Voice Output support
- 🌐 Multilingual interaction
- 📄 Government Scheme Recommendation
- 📑 Document & Eligibility Guidance
- 🤖 Intent Detection using Machine Learning
- 🧠 LLM-powered intelligent responses using Ollama
- ⚡ FastAPI backend
- 🎨 Modern Next.js frontend

---

# 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS

### Backend
- FastAPI
- Python

### AI / Machine Learning
- Scikit-learn
- TF-IDF Vectorizer
- Support Vector Machine (SVM)
- NLP

### LLM
- Ollama

### Voice Processing
- Whisper

