---

# 🚀 Installation

## Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Sakshi09ii/AI-Government-Service-Assistant.git
```

## Backend

```bash
cd backend

pip install -r requirements.txt

python api.py
```

## Frontend

```bash
cd frontend

npm install

npm run dev
```

